OL,3,GNEWSADeath of 18-year-old not being
OL,4,Atreated as suspicious
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say the death of an 18-year-old
OL,7,Fman is not being treated as suspicious,
OL,8,Fafter his body was found in
OL,9,FLeicestershire.
OL,11,FJames Corlett, from Swadlincote in
OL,12,FDerbyshire, was reported missing after
OL,13,Fhe did not return home following a
OL,14,Fnight out in Ashby-de-la-Zouch,
OL,15,FLeicestershire, on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
PN,36202
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1793687247
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSADeath of 18-year-old not being
OL,4,Atreated as suspicious
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquiry was launched by Derbyshire
OL,7,FPolice, before on Saturday it was
OL,8,Ftransferred to neighbouring
OL,9,FLeicestershire Police, which confirmed
OL,10,Fa body had been found in
OL,11,FAshby-de-la-Zouch and that Corlett's
OL,12,Fdeath was currently being "treated as
OL,13,Funexplained".
OL,15,FOn Monday, Leicestershire Police
OL,16,Fconfirmed that the death was not being
OL,17,Ftreated as suspicious, and said
OL,18,Fofficers were preparing a file for the
OL,19,Fcoroner.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
